Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 21:11:47 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Add a loopback control API for live camera
 transformations

ControlApiService listens on 127.0.0.1:8899 (BABALLONIA_CONTROL_PORT, 0 = off):
GET /status returns the face/left/right CameraSettings, POST /transform changes
any of roi/rotation/gamma/red channel/flips live, applied on the UI thread
through the same pipeline-manager setters the crop UI uses. For an external
continuous re-centering tool. Live only: not saved, and the UI crop doesn't follow.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
